  },
  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CDDTBQWG000",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "cli-packaging.md",
    "text": "Added `stripInlineAnchors` (`astParser.ts`) and applied it everywhere a block's stored abstract/text gets compared against a fresh disk parse for exact equality: `extractAbstract` (before truncating, so a mid-window anchor can't survive as a mangled fragment either), `reconcile.ts`'s `leafKey` (block-level Gestalt matching), and the rename matchers' own key computation (`apeironNgn/artifacts.ts`). Verified against the two real cases that surfaced this (`design/cli.md`'s Discussion bullet, `discussion/cli.md`'s staging-practice paragraph): stripped text now round-trips exactly.",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR001",
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDDVC338001"
    ],
    "path": "discussion/cli-packaging.md",
    "fileHash": "574ee968615f4c9384b4bd7b33bd7298ebda286432d90620507085ab6320d597",
    "lastTrackedAt": "2026-09-10T10:39:40.930Z",
    "ingestedHash": "574ee968615f4c9384b4bd7b33bd7298ebda286432d90620507085ab6320d597",
    "lastIngestedAt": "2026-09-10T10:41:16.615Z",
    "projectedHash": "574ee968615f4c9384b4bd7b33bd7298ebda286432d90620507085ab6320d597"
  },
  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CDDTBYG0000",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "cli-packaging.md",
    "text": "**`kg:*` only runs from inside this source checkout.** Every command requires `npm run kg:X --` from `Aperas/web`, with `tsx` and the rest of the devDependencies installed — not something an end user installing a skill that shells out to `kg` can rely on. See [Motivation](../discussion/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC33G006).",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR003",
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0001"
    ],
    "path": "issues/cli-packaging.md",
    "fileHash": "ff71840c686bf18a91e63c517a853b2eb3f556fab43c78d0a5d99c0691e89afd",
    "lastTrackedAt": "2026-09-10T10:39:40.929Z",
    "ingestedHash": "ff71840c686bf18a91e63c517a853b2eb3f556fab43c78d0a5d99c0691e89afd",
    "lastIngestedAt": "2026-09-10T10:41:17.234Z",
    "projectedHash": "ff71840c686bf18a91e63c517a853b2eb3f556fab43c78d0a5d99c0691e89afd"
  },
  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CDDTC3S0000",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "cli-packaging.md",
    "text": "To be broken down once [the graph-location question](../issues/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0002) has an answer — [the dispatcher refactor itself](../design/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVBXHG005) doesn't depend on it, but shipping a usable package does.",
